  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amplifying women&apos;s political voice in Nkhotakota and Mangochi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal  of Amplifying women&apos;s political voice project is Promote meaningful participation of women leaders in political and  decision -making processes by 2025 in Nkhotakota and Mangochi districts with the following specific objectives; To enhance the political representation of women and young women in elected positions at national and local levels in Nkhotakota and Mangochi and To   increase the influence of women and young women on political parties&apos; operations in Malawi by 2025 in Mangochi and Nkhotakota and Mangochi districts. The project  will support the capacity building of female aspirants and support awareness on the participation of women in politics.</narrative>
  </description>
